{"content_hash": "304c6556db65057d", "version_id": 922, "article_id": 93, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "OnePlus Ace 7 brings a cooling fan and a huge battery for gamers", "title_zh": "一加Ace 7发布：内置散热风扇和超大电池，专为游戏玩家打造", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "mydrivers_ev", "source_url": "https://news.mydrivers.com/1/1163/1163909.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600373633615-9b045feaa299?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8cHJvJTIwYWNlJTIwbWFofGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQyODIxOTB8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Badhan Ganesh on Unsplash", "author": "Badhan Ganesh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@badhanganesh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/ace-of-spade-playing-card-wYFYDP9r8BY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(28, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(66, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "5044abb86628"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-10", "word_count": 103, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "OnePlus has launched the Ace 7, a new phone built for people who play a lot of games. It has a fan inside, a very fast screen and a big battery.", "lead_zh": "一加推出了Ace 7，这是一款专为重度游戏玩家打造的新手机。它内置风扇，配备超高刷屏幕和超大电池。", "preview": "The OnePlus Ace 7 is a standard model, but its features are close to a Pro phone. It has a cooling fan inside with two air paths. This keeps", "preview_zh": "一加Ace 7是一款标准版机型，但配置却接近Pro级别。它内置双路风冷散热风扇，能在长时间游戏时保持手机凉爽。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 908, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 43.425, "size_bytes": 261504, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 128, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 44.425, "size_bytes": 267552, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 128, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 47.875, "size_bytes": 288144, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 128, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 40.175, "size_bytes": 242064, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 128, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 44.075, "size_bytes": 265392, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 128, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@0cb59f2/content/data/versions/922.json", "paragraphs": ["The OnePlus Ace 7 is a standard model, but its features are close to a Pro phone. It has a cooling fan inside with two air paths. This keeps the phone cool during long game sessions.", "The screen is 185Hz, so games look very smooth. OnePlus says the fan can lower the phone's temperature by about 10°C. The phone also has IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K water and dust protection.", "The battery is 9000mAh, which is very large for a phone. It supports 100W fast charging. The main camera is 200 megapixels. OnePlus says the Ace 7 is made for serious mobile gamers."], "paragraphs_zh": ["一加Ace 7是一款标准版机型，但配置却接近Pro级别。它内置双路风冷散热风扇，能在长时间游戏时保持手机凉爽。", "屏幕刷新率高达185Hz，游戏画面非常流畅。一加表示风扇能让手机温度降低约10°C。手机还支持IP66、IP68、IP69和IP69K防尘防水。", "电池容量为9000mAh，在手机中非常大，并支持100W超级闪充。主摄像头为2亿像素。一加称Ace 7专为重度手游玩家打造。"], "body": "The OnePlus Ace 7 is a standard model, but its features are close to a Pro phone. It has a cooling fan inside with two air paths. This keeps the phone cool during long game sessions.\n\nThe screen is 185Hz, so games look very smooth. OnePlus says the fan can lower the phone's temperature by about 10°C. The phone also has IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K water and dust protection.\n\nThe battery is 9000mAh, which is very large for a phone. It supports 100W fast charging. The main camera is 200 megapixels. OnePlus says the Ace 7 is made for serious mobile gamers.", "body_zh": "一加Ace 7是一款标准版机型，但配置却接近Pro级别。它内置双路风冷散热风扇，能在长时间游戏时保持手机凉爽。\n\n屏幕刷新率高达185Hz，游戏画面非常流畅。一加表示风扇能让手机温度降低约10°C。手机还支持IP66、IP68、IP69和IP69K防尘防水。\n\n电池容量为9000mAh，在手机中非常大，并支持100W超级闪充。主摄像头为2亿像素。一加称Ace 7专为重度手游玩家打造。", "text": "The OnePlus Ace 7 is a standard model, but its features are close to a Pro phone. It has a cooling fan inside with two air paths. This keeps the phone cool during long game sessions. The screen is 185Hz, so games look very smooth. OnePlus says the fan can lower the phone's temperature by about 10°C. The phone also has IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K water and dust protection. The battery is 9000mAh, which is very large for a phone. It supports 100W fast charging. The main camera is 200 megapixels. OnePlus says the Ace 7 is made for serious mobile gamers.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布", "note": "常用作动词，表示产品发布", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "standard", "pos": "adj", "zh": "标准的", "note": "standard model 指标准版", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cooling", "pos": "noun", "zh": "冷却；散热", "note": "cooling fan 散热风扇", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fan", "pos": "noun", "zh": "风扇", "note": "内置风扇", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "screen", "pos": "noun", "zh": "屏幕", "note": "185Hz screen 185Hz屏幕", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "battery", "pos": "noun", "